CONTENT cand=T0026 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Long TV series are better than movies for telling stories. "
CONTENT cand=T0059 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Country music tells better stories than any other genre. "
CONTENT cand=T0063 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Acoustic versions are usually better than the originals. "
CONTENT cand=T0089 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="I feel that handwritten to-do lists work better than apps. "
CONTENT cand=T0095 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Pop music was better in the 1980s than it is now. "
CONTENT cand=T0156 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Reindeer eyes turn blue in winter to see better in the dark Arctic months. "
CONTENT cand=T0236 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Oat milk is better than dairy milk in coffee. "
CONTENT cand=T0245 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="The Olympics are better than any professional league. "
CONTENT cand=T0262 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Room-temperature water tastes better than ice water. "
CONTENT cand=T0278 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Cats make better pets than dogs. "
CONTENT cand=T0343 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Live concerts are always better than studio recordings. "
CONTENT cand=T0344 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Homework improves how much students learn. "
CONTENT cand=T0357 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Summer nights are better than summer days. "
CONTENT cand=T0364 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="More megapixels always mean better photographs. "
CONTENT cand=T0374 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="School uniforms improve student behavior. "
CONTENT cand=T0441 ovl=1 interp=SUP text="Subtitles are better than dubbing, always. "
